        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Doll of carved wood, in green silk dress and yellow petticoat; English, early 18th century."@en , "Wooden doll, carved and gessoed wood with inset glass lozenge eyes. Dotted brows, carved ears. Human hair wig. Dressed in a round gown in plain apple-green silk, over a yellow quilted silk petticoat. Heavy white linen petticoat.. Lace-edged linen cap and plain linen apron. Linen shift with frilled edge to sleeve created with gathering.  No shoes or stockings, right foot broken."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c930102c-e6f6-3c4e-a6b4-b25cebf00abb> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/73a8ba6b-45cb-3a9e-ab04-6521f7f1cc29> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/947e1806-ca1d-37ce-a839-748ed11c8fa0> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/eb70cdcc-9258-3bf3-ae84-dded5c75466b> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Doll of carved wood, in green silk dress and yellow petticoat; English, early 18th century."@en , "Wooden doll, carved and gessoed wood with inset glass lozenge eyes. Dotted brows, carved ears. Human hair wig. Dressed in a round gown in plain apple-green silk, over a yellow quilted silk petticoat. Heavy white linen petticoat.. Lace-edged linen cap and plain linen apron. Linen shift with frilled edge to sleeve created with gathering.  No shoes or stockings, right foot broken."@en ;
